{title: Dil Galti Kar Baitha Hai}
{artist: Nusrat Fateh Ali Khan Bol Kaffara}
{key: D#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[D#m] Dil galti kar [C#] baitha hai,        [D#m] galti kar [B] baitha hai dil
[D#m] Dil galti kar [C#] baitha hai,        [D#m] galti kar [B] baitha hai dil
[D#m] Dil galti kar [C#] baitha hai,        [D#m] galti kar [B] baitha hai [D#m] dil
[D#m] Dil galti kar [C#] baitha tu,        [B] bol kaffara kya [D#m] hoga
[D#m] Mere dil ki dil [C#] se tauba,        [D#m] dil se tauba [B] mere Dil ki
[D#m] Mere dil ki dil [C#] se tauba,        [D#m] dil se tauba [B] mere Dil ki
[D#m] Dil ki tauba [C#] aye dil ab,        [B] pyaar dobara na [D#m] hoga
[D#m] Tu bol kaffara, kaffara,        [C#] bol kaffara, tu [D#m] bol
Kaffara, kaffara [C#] bol kaffara kaffara bol,        [B] Woh yaara, woh yaara
[C#] bol kaffara kya [D#m] hoga,        [D#m] Jugnoo jugnoo kar ke [B] tere milne
Ke deep [D#m] Jalaaye hai,        [D#m] Humne jugnu jugnu karke,
[B] tere milne Ki deep [D#m] jalaye hai,        [D#m] Akhiyon me moti bhar bhar ke,
[B] tere hizr Mein haath uthaaye hai,        [D#m] Tere naam ke harf ki [C#] tasbeeh ko
[D#m] Sanso Ke gale ka haar,        [C#] kiya [D#m] duniya bhuli
Aur [C#] sirf tujhe haan,        [B] Sirf tujhe hi pyaar kiya [D#m]
[D#m] Tumhe humse badhkar duniya, [C#] duniya,        Tumhe hum [B] se badh kar
[D#m] Tumhe hum se badh kar duniya, [C#] duniya,        Tumhe hum [B] se badh kar [D#m]
[D#m] Humko tum se [C#] badh kar koi,        [B] jaan se pyara Na hoga [D#m]
[D#m] Tu bol kaffara, kaffara,        [C#] bol kaffara, tu [D#m] bol
Kaffara, kaffara [C#] bol kaffara, kaffara bol
[B] Wo yaara, wo yaara [C#] bol kaffara kya [D#m] hoga
